/* ------------------------------------------------------- the library */

/* The one text hlswfix.dll ever shows. It sits here, under an id of its own
 * far from the others so that it lands in a string block of its own, because
 * otherwise the library would have to carry all seventeen languages of a
 * dialog it never opens: sixty eight kilobytes for one sentence. Nothing is
 * duplicated, this text belongs to the library and the ones above belong to
 * the launcher. */
